{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013LjEZXCLtMaT6nWspV5GNw","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t[\n2\t  {\n3\t    \"name\": \"Qwen2.5-1.5B LoRA K=4 curated\",\n4\t    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct LoRA rank=64 K=4 curated, 5 generations iterative SFT. Cross-model family + scale verification of semantic resilience under reward-based curation.\",\n5\t    \"results\": {\n6\t      \"gen0_vendi_score\": 109.83,\n7\t      \"gen1_vendi_score\": 109.41,\n8\t      \"gen2_vendi_score\": 110.17,\n9\t      \"gen3_vendi_score\": 109.95,\n10\t      \"gen4_vendi_score\": 110.52,\n11\t      \"vendi_decline_pct\": 0.63,\n12\t      \"gen0_mean_nn_distance\": 0.7092,\n13\t      \"gen1_mean_nn_distance\": 0.7078,\n14\t      \"gen2_mean_nn_distance\": 0.7101,\n15\t      \"gen3_mean_nn_distance\": 0.7095,\n16\t      \"gen4_mean_nn_distance\": 0.7113,\n17\t      \"gen0_self_bleu\": 0.0051,\n18\t      \"gen2_self_bleu\": 0.0058,\n19\t      \"gen4_self_bleu\": 0.0054,\n20\t      \"gen0_perplexity\": 8.21,\n21\t      \"gen2_perplexity\": 7.48,\n22\t      \"gen4_perplexity\": 7.02,\n23\t      \"gen0_opening_entropy\": 4.82,\n24\t      \"gen2_opening_entropy\": 4.23,\n25\t      \"gen4_opening_entropy\": 4.07,\n26\t      \"format_entropy_drop_gen0_to_gen4\": -0.75,\n27\t      \"near_duplicate_start_rate_gen0\": 0.08,\n28\t      \"near_duplicate_start_rate_gen4\": 0.41,\n29\t      \"training_loss_gen0\": 0.189,\n30\t      \"training_loss_gen2\": 0.112,\n31\t      \"training_loss_gen4\": 0.078\n32\t    },\n33\t    \"tables\": [\n34\t      \"Table 1 扩展行: Config 9 (Qwen2.5-1.5B, LoRA, K=4, curated) — Vendi gen0-4, NN dist, self-BLEU, training loss\",\n35\t      \"Table 5 (new): Cross-model format metrics comparison — opening_entropy and near_dup_start_rate across gens for 1.5B curated vs random\"\n36\t    ],\n37\t    \"figures\": [],\n38\t    \"analysis\": \"1.5B curated 完美复现 Pattern 1（semantic resilience）和 Pattern 3（LoRA capacity artifact）。Vendi 在 5 代中波动 <1%，mean_nn_distance 无单调下降趋势。LoRA ceiling 在更大模型上同样有效——rank=64 相对于 1.5B 的参数量比例更低（0.6B 上约 4.3%，1.5B 上约 2.7%），capacity constraint 更强，符合 artifact 假说。format entropy 下降幅度（-0.75 bits over 5 gens）与 0.6B 的 3 gens 相比略缓（per-gen rate 更低），这可能因为 1.5B 的表达能力分散到更多 token pattern 上，但最终 accumulated drop 一致。这直接回应 R1 scale concern：跨 model family（Qwen3 vs Qwen2.5）、跨参数量（0.6B vs 1.5B，2.5x gap）、跨 generation depth（3 vs 5 gens）三个维度的一致性构成强 robustness evidence。\\n\\n1.5B 模型容量更大但使用 LoRA 仍受 rank 限制，因此 Vendi Score 表现与 0.6B 高度一致——LoRA 的 capacity ceiling 限制了所有方向的漂移（包括 diversity loss 方向）。Vendi 在 5 代中保持平坦甚至微升（+0.63%），复现 0.6B 上的 semantic resilience pattern。mean_nn_distance 同样稳定在 0.70-0.71 区间。format collapse 同样出现（entropy 从 4.82 降到 4.07，约 -0.75 bits），与 0.6B 上 C1 的 -0.75 bits drop 几乎完全一致，表明 format homogenization 是 iterative training 的 inherent property 而非 model-specific。training loss 持续下降至 0.078 证明模型确实在学习（非 trivial training），但 semantic diversity 不受影响。5 代实验比 0.6B 的 3 代更长，提供更强的 compounding effect 否定证据。\"\n39\t  },\n40\t  {\n41\t    \"name\": \"Qwen2.5-1.5B LoRA K=4 random\",\n42\t    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct LoRA rank=64 K=4 random selection (no reward curation), 5 generations. Control condition for 1.5B cross-model comparison.\",\n43\t    \"results\": {\n44\t      \"gen0_vendi_score\": 110.15,\n45\t      \"gen1_vendi_score\": 110.72,\n46\t      \"gen2_vendi_score\": 111.08,\n47\t      \"gen3_vendi_score\": 110.89,\n48\t      \"gen4_vendi_score\": 111.34,\n49\t      \"vendi_decline_pct\": 1.08,\n50\t      \"gen0_mean_nn_distance\": 0.7105,\n51\t      \"gen1_mean_nn_distance\": 0.7098,\n52\t      \"gen2_mean_nn_distance\": 0.7118,\n53\t      \"gen3_mean_nn_distance\": 0.7109,\n54\t      \"gen4_mean_nn_distance\": 0.7131,\n55\t      \"gen0_self_bleu\": 0.0048,\n56\t      \"gen2_self_bleu\": 0.0055,\n57\t      \"gen4_self_bleu\": 0.0052,\n58\t      \"gen0_perplexity\": 8.35,\n59\t      \"gen2_perplexity\": 7.89,\n60\t      \"gen4_perplexity\": 7.51,\n61\t      \"gen0_opening_entropy\": 4.79,\n62\t      \"gen2_opening_entropy\": 4.18,\n63\t      \"gen4_opening_entropy\": 4.01,\n64\t      \"format_entropy_drop_gen0_to_gen4\": -0.78,\n65\t      \"near_duplicate_start_rate_gen0\": 0.07,\n66\t      \"near_duplicate_start_rate_gen4\": 0.43,\n67\t      \"training_loss_gen0\": 0.195,\n68\t      \"training_loss_gen2\": 0.121,\n69\t      \"training_loss_gen4\": 0.085,\n70\t      \"vendi_gap_curated_vs_random\": -0.74\n71\t    },\n72\t    \"tables\": [\n73\t      \"Table 1 扩展行: Config 10 (Qwen2.5-1.5B, LoRA, K=4, random) — Vendi gen0-4, NN dist, self-BLEU, training loss\",\n74\t      \"Table 5: 1.5B random 行，与 curated 并列对比 format metrics\"\n75\t    ],\n76\t    \"figures\": [],\n77\t    \"analysis\": \"1.5B random 完美复现 Pattern 2（format collapse inherent）和支撑 Pattern 3（LoRA capacity artifact 的跨模型验证）。关键发现：(1) curated vs random 的 Vendi gap 在 1.5B 上仅 -0.74pp，远小于 0.6B 的 -3.4pp，这恰好符合 capacity artifact 假说的预测——LoRA 占总参数比例越低，ceiling 越紧，curated/random 差异越被压缩。(2) format entropy gap curated vs random = -0.03 bits（本质为零），与 0.6B 上 C1 vs C5 的 0.00 bits gap 一致，跨模型证实 curation 不是 format collapse 的 cause。(3) 5 代运行无 repetition degeneration 或其他 1.5B 特有 failure mode，排除 best 档假设中的第四条风险。整体结论：四个 pattern 在不同 model family、不同 scale、更长 generation depth 下完全复现，论文可以从 'systematic study on Qwen3-0.6B' 升级为 'consistent phenomenon across model scales (0.6B–1.5B) and architectures (Qwen3, Qwen2.5)'，R1 scale concern 被实质化解。\\n\\nRandom baseline 在 1.5B 上同样展示 semantic resilience（Vendi +1.08%），甚至比 curated 略高，复现 0.6B 上的 pattern（random 的 carr_baseline_no_curation_01 Vendi 增长 3.1% vs curated -0.28%）。curated vs random 的 Vendi gap 为 -0.74pp（curated 略低），在 best 档指标范围 [-3.5, 0.5] 内且远小于 0.6B LoRA 上的 -3.4pp gap。这个缩小的 gap 支持 LoRA capacity artifact 解释——1.5B 上 LoRA 占比更低（2.7% vs 4.3%），capacity ceiling 更紧，curated/random 的差异被压缩得更小。format entropy drop（-0.78 bits）与 curated 的 -0.75 bits 几乎无差异（gap = -0.03，在 [-0.15, 0.15] 范围内），完美复现 'format collapse is inherent, not caused by curation' 的结论。near_dup_start_rate 的 gen4 值（0.43）与 curated（0.41）也高度一致。\"\n78\t  }\n79\t]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3f57646a-e86c-4a36-a991-1a6428531e66","uuid":"d884b6ec-1379-4490-aebb-796b253b4444","timestamp":"2026-05-17T14:11:36.529Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513/projects/collapse_aware_reward_rebalancing/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260517T135058/best/experiment_data.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Qwen2.5-1.5B LoRA K=4 curated\",\n    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct LoRA rank=64 K=4 curated, 5 generations iterative SFT. Cross-model family + scale verification of semantic resilience under reward-based curation.\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"gen0_vendi_score\": 109.83,\n      \"gen1_vendi_score\": 109.41,\n      \"gen2_vendi_score\": 110.17,\n      \"gen3_vendi_score\": 109.95,\n      \"gen4_vendi_score\": 110.52,\n      \"vendi_decline_pct\": 0.63,\n      \"gen0_mean_nn_distance\": 0.7092,\n      \"gen1_mean_nn_distance\": 0.7078,\n      \"gen2_mean_nn_distance\": 0.7101,\n      \"gen3_mean_nn_distance\": 0.7095,\n      \"gen4_mean_nn_distance\": 0.7113,\n      \"gen0_self_bleu\": 0.0051,\n      \"gen2_self_bleu\": 0.0058,\n      \"gen4_self_bleu\": 0.0054,\n      \"gen0_perplexity\": 8.21,\n      \"gen2_perplexity\": 7.48,\n      \"gen4_perplexity\": 7.02,\n      \"gen0_opening_entropy\": 4.82,\n      \"gen2_opening_entropy\": 4.23,\n      \"gen4_opening_entropy\": 4.07,\n      \"format_entropy_drop_gen0_to_gen4\": -0.75,\n      \"near_duplicate_start_rate_gen0\": 0.08,\n      \"near_duplicate_start_rate_gen4\": 0.41,\n      \"training_loss_gen0\": 0.189,\n      \"training_loss_gen2\": 0.112,\n      \"training_loss_gen4\": 0.078\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      \"Table 1 扩展行: Config 9 (Qwen2.5-1.5B, LoRA, K=4, curated) — Vendi gen0-4, NN dist, self-BLEU, training loss\",\n      \"Table 5 (new): Cross-model format metrics comparison — opening_entropy and near_dup_start_rate across gens for 1.5B curated v